[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5581.36, "timestamp": "01:33:01", "text": "我不是。 那里似乎有很多粉丝式的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5584.0, "timestamp": "01:33:04", "text": "那里似乎有很多粉丝式的 指责，但我不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5587.679, "timestamp": "01:33:07", "text": "指责，但我不是。 我就是我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5597.189, "timestamp": "01:33:17", "text": "可惜，不是那个狂热粉丝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5604.95, "timestamp": "01:33:24", "text": "好的。 呃，我从哪儿弄来的？好吧，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5611.59, "timestamp": "01:33:31", "text": "一个可爱的小男孩。  [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5618.149, "timestamp": "01:33:38", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5627.91, "timestamp": "01:33:47", "text": "哦，等等。 这里有个营地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5638.79, "timestamp": "01:33:58", "text": "我认为这给了我们一个观看的理由。"}]